24
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:52,400
500 years ago

25
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:26,280
That bastard Lin Yi

26
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:28,320
sent us here to die.

27
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:31,840
Heng Yuezi
Heng Yue Sect Founder
Late stage Nascent Soul

28
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,360
Stop complaining

29
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:32,400
and focus on finding a way out.

30
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:52,520
A spatial rift !

31
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:53,520
That was close !

32
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:56,520
Go !

33
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,040
Thank you.

34
00:03:01,040 --> 00:03:03,200
I, Piao Nanzi, will repay this debt.

35
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:07,320
Brother, you don't need to worry about such small matters.

36
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:11,440
These spatial rifts are unpredictable.

37
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:13,040
Their suction force

38
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:16,000
can overpower even a Giant Demon Clan's Nascent Soul.

39
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:19,240
I heard that those spatial rifts

40
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:22,000
can forcibly extract the spiritual energy from your body.

41
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:27,240
Who knows what lies beyond them in the void ?

42
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:27,240
Please, someone help me !

43
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:28,600
Save me !

44
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:34,160
500 years later

45
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:44,200
Wandering soul
